<p align="center"><b><h2>The Lost Cabal</h2></b></p>
<p align="center"><b><h3>The Beginning</h3></b></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The real beginnings of The Lost Cabal can be traced back
to two people joined in a mutual desire to form a guild that could, through its
members, make Norrath a fun place to visit.&nbsp; These two dreamers were lucky
enough to find friends who shared that quest.&nbsp; Good people. People you can
trust to guard your back in a fight or to share their last rations during a
lengthy adventure.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; As The Lost Cabal, we try to remember and encourage people
to remember the effect they can have on other Norrathians.&nbsp; We have few
guidelines and regulations. Play nice and help others about encompass the
restrictions on our members.&nbsp; We try to be helpful to any in need, even
those outside the guild.</p>

